   Additions:
	- If you do not use the protocol "USR X2 and V90", for acceleration
           of a procedure handshake it is desirable them to prohibit through
           S58.0=1 and S58.5=1
	- In wearing there is an interesting register S58.1 of "Bler monitor",
           the installation S58.1=1 can sometimes help on bad communication
           lines.
	- And self-test on AT&T1 коннект can be 28800, but for want of of real
	   communication on V34 +, коннект reaches up to 33600.
	- Remind to you, that in this wearing there is built-in USR a ATY16
	   command, for review is peak - frequent the characteristics of a line.
	- All numerical significances - only in the decimal system, as yet
	   rarity the users, who don't know about existence hexadecimal :)

